        "candidate_id": "C_84d8637e26c77ccf_0",
        "edit": "Add the missing else branch so that when s is not 0, y is assigned b, completing the 2:1 mux behavior and fixing the cycle-3 output mismatch.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n    \n        \n\nif(s==1'B0)begin y=a;end\n        else begin y=b; end\n\t\nendmodule",
